v1.1.1-s4
Release notes:
1. Stop installation when panel settings or service restarts fail.
2. Require both a certificate and private key for HTTPS; stop on configuration failure.
3. Probe the saved panel port, base path, and HTTP/HTTPS response after installation or upgrade.
4. Display login URLs using the live protocol instead of certificate marker files.
5. Add panel-readiness regression tests to CI.
